<text><loc_44><loc_387><loc_244><loc_423>In addition, we simulate the relative pose transformation T L j Li (the j th body's pose at i th body frame), which can be computed by iterative closest point (ICP) method toward LiDAR's point cloud. Hence, the LiDAR factor is simplified as:</text>
<formula><loc_79><loc_422><loc_244><loc_436></formula>
<text><loc_44><loc_438><loc_244><loc_464>where T w Li represent the LiDAR's pose at timestamp i , T w L j represent the LiDAR's pose at timestamp j , and L P i j is the covariance matrix of relative pose T Li L j .</text>
